      "pinyin": "nǎ ge diàn yǐng hǎo kàn ne dà xīng de bà ba kàn kan zhè ge kàn kan nà ge",
      "english": "Which movie was good? Daxing’s dad looked at this one and looked at that one."
    },
    {
